{"id":"level-up-2026-09-30","name":"2026-09-30 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s601","en":"I usually do the laundry while listening to the radio.","zh":"我通常一边听广播一边洗衣服。","note":"laundry · 洗衣房； 待洗衣服 · do the laundry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s602","en":"She refused to hold a grudge over a minor disagreement.","zh":"她不愿为一次小分歧怀恨在心。","note":"grudge · 不满，积怨， · hold a grudge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s603","en":"Researchers began to accumulate evidence from several independent studies.","zh":"研究人员开始从几项独立研究中积累证据。","note":"accumulate · 积累； 堆积 · accumulate evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s604","en":"The library hosts a monthly discussion group for crime novels.","zh":"图书馆每月举办一次犯罪小说读书会。","note":"crime · 罪行； 犯罪 · a crime novel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s605","en":"Low stone walls surround the village's oldest vegetable gardens.","zh":"低矮的石墙围绕着村里最古老的菜园。","note":"surround · 围绕； 包围 · surround a village","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s606","en":"He spends most of his leisure time restoring old bicycles.","zh":"他把大部分闲暇时间用来修复旧自行车。","note":"leisure · 空闲时间； 悠闲 · leisure time","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s607","en":"The narrow pavement becomes crowded when the school day ends.","zh":"放学时，狭窄的人行道变得拥挤。","note":"pavement · 人行道； 地面， 路面 · a narrow pavement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s608","en":"The spelling error went undetected until the book was printed.","zh":"这个拼写错误直到书印出来才被发现。","note":"undetected · 未被发现的 · go undetected","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s609","en":"The review found an irregularity in the recorded delivery dates.","zh":"审查发现记录中的送货日期有一处异常。","note":"irregularity · 不规则， 无规律 · an accounting irregularity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s610","en":"Students need time to assimilate new information before discussing it.","zh":"学生讨论新信息前，需要时间消化吸收。","note":"assimilate · 吸收； 使同化 · assimilate information","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s611","en":"The seminar raised ethical questions about collecting personal data.","zh":"研讨会提出了收集个人数据所涉及的伦理问题。","note":"ethical · 道德的； 伦理的 · ethical questions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s612","en":"The exhibition traces the cultivation of rice across the region.","zh":"展览追溯了这个地区种植水稻的历史。","note":"cultivation · 耕种， 耕作； 培养， 教育 · the cultivation of crops","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s613","en":"My brother calls himself a coffee addict after every late shift.","zh":"每次上完晚班，弟弟都说自己是个咖啡迷。","note":"addict · 吸毒成瘾的人， 有瘾的人， 对…入迷的人 · a coffee addict","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s614","en":"The hilltop offers a marvellous view of the harbour.","zh":"从山顶可以欣赏到港口的绝美景色。","note":"marvellous · 令人惊奇的； 奇特的， 非凡的； 奇迹般的， 不可思议的； 绝妙的 · a marvellous view","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s615","en":"The bicycle's aluminium frame makes it easier to carry upstairs.","zh":"自行车的铝制车架让它更容易被搬上楼。","note":"aluminium · 铝 · an aluminium frame","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s616","en":"We need a trustworthy source for the historical dates.","zh":"我们需要可靠的来源来核实这些历史日期。","note":"trustworthy · 值得信赖的， 可靠的 · a trustworthy source","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s617","en":"The two surveys produced comparable results despite their different methods.","zh":"尽管方法不同，两次调查得出了相近的结果。","note":"comparable · 可比较的， 类似的； 比得上的 · comparable results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s618","en":"Completing the difficult project helped build her self-esteem.","zh":"完成这个困难的项目帮助她增强了自尊与自信。","note":"self-esteem · 自尊； 自负 · build self-esteem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s619","en":"The engineer checked the dimensional accuracy of each wooden component.","zh":"工程师检查了每个木制部件的尺寸精度。","note":"dimensional · …度空间的， …维的 · dimensional accuracy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s620","en":"The café was closed, presumably because the owners were away.","zh":"咖啡馆关门了，大概是因为店主外出了。","note":"presumably · 推测起来， 大概 · presumably because","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s621","en":"History became my favourite subject after our visit to the museum.","zh":"参观博物馆后，历史成了我最喜欢的科目。","note":"subject · 受…支配的， 取决于…的； 易遭受…的；题目；学科；主语['sʌbdʒ3kt] · a favourite subject","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s622","en":"The flat's small balcony was an unexpected bonus.","zh":"公寓的小阳台是一个意料之外的额外好处。","note":"bonus · 奖金， 红利； 好处 · an added bonus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s623","en":"Her early photographs gained recognition at a local arts festival.","zh":"她早期的摄影作品在一个当地艺术节上获得了认可。","note":"recognition · 识别； 认出； 承认， 确认， 认可； 赏识， 表彰 · gain recognition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s624","en":"I prefer an aisle seat on long train journeys.","zh":"长途坐火车时，我更喜欢靠过道的座位。","note":"aisle · 走廊， 通道； 侧廊 · an aisle seat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s625","en":"Please confirm the travel arrangements before booking your accommodation.","zh":"预订住宿前，请确认出行安排。","note":"arrangement · 安排； · travel arrangements","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s626","en":"Ticket revenue helped cover the cost of restoring the theatre.","zh":"门票收入帮助支付了修复剧院的费用。","note":"revenue · 收入； 税收 · ticket revenue","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s627","en":"A narrow strip of grass separates the path from the road.","zh":"一条窄草带把小路与公路隔开。","note":"strip · 剥夺；夺去，使空无一物；拆卸，拆开；带状物； 条纹； 狭长地带， 带状水域 · a strip of land","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s628","en":"For years, one company held a monopoly on local deliveries.","zh":"多年来，一家公司垄断了当地配送业务。","note":"monopoly · 垄断， 专卖； 垄断商品， 专卖商品 · a virtual monopoly","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s629","en":"The workshop encourages continuous improvement through regular feedback.","zh":"工作坊通过定期反馈，鼓励持续改进。","note":"continuous · 连续的， 不断的 · continuous improvement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s630","en":"A bilingual dictionary helped me understand the unfamiliar recipe.","zh":"一本双语词典帮助我看懂了陌生的食谱。","note":"bilingual · 两种语言的 · a bilingual dictionary","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s631","en":"The former school building is now a private residence.","zh":"原来的学校建筑现在是一处私人住宅。","note":"residence · 住宅， 住处； 居住 · a private residence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s632","en":"The experiment measured how much oxygen the plants released.","zh":"实验测量了这些植物释放的氧气量。","note":"oxygen · 氧， 氧气 · release oxygen","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s633","en":"She joined an intensive course before taking the language exam.","zh":"参加语言考试前，她上了一门强化课程。","note":"intensive · 加强的； 密集的 · an intensive course","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s634","en":"We had to alter our route because the bridge was closed.","zh":"因为桥关闭了，我们不得不调整路线。","note":"alter · 改变； 变动 · alter a plan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s635","en":"The recipe asks you to combine flour with warm water.","zh":"食谱要求把面粉与温水混合。","note":"combine · 联合， 结合 · combine with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s636","en":"The quiet courtyard is an ideal location for outdoor reading.","zh":"安静的庭院是户外阅读的理想地点。","note":"ideal · 理想的，完美的；理想主义的；空想的；唯心的；理想； 理想的东西 · an ideal location","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s637","en":"We watched a light comedy after a demanding day.","zh":"忙碌了一天后，我们看了一部轻松的喜剧。","note":"comedy · 喜剧； 喜剧性 · a romantic comedy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-30:s638","en":"He used a broom to clear leaves from the doorway.","zh":"他用扫帚清理了门口的落叶。","note":"broom · 扫帚 · a wooden broom","recordings":[]},{"id":"c